  "generalAbilities": [
    {
      "name": "Cute Aggression",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>Floolf pups are so adorable that any creature that is either a mammal, or has an Intelligence above 3 that sees or touches a floolf pup must succeed at a DC 27 Will Saving Throw save or it will defend the floolf pup with its life. This effect ends when the creature is no longer able to perceive the pup.</p>\n<p>If the creature can speak, anytime it remembers the floolf pup, it feels a compulsion (DC 15 Will Saving Throw save) to tell their story of the encounter, invariably ending with the phrase, \"I would die for that floolf.\"</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
